repository-code: "https://github.com/forgemorrow/llm-test-generation-quarantine"
abstract: >
  Replication package for the empirical study "Why Do LLM-Generated Unit Tests
  Fail to Enter Continuous Integration? A Multi-Stage Empirical Study on
  SWE-bench Verified". Contains the five-gate zero-leakage empirical audit logs,
  per-test timeout resolutions, N=20 hermetic and N=10 open-network shuffle
  repeatability logs, HTTP mock-remediation evaluations, analysis/figure/table
  generation scripts (results/empirical_study_20261118/ and
  scripts/empirical_study_20261118/), together with the archived baseline
  artifacts and socket-guard instrumentation.
keywords:
  - large language models
  - unit test generation
  - flaky tests
  - continuous integration
  - test quarantine
  - SWE-bench Verified
  - empirical software engineering
